{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":26370,"name":"","username":"Jedi_dtechmaker","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/jedi_dtechmaker/{size}/11240_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-06T08:23:52.876Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eOn October 3, 2026, we brought CKB Off Chain to Aba, Abia State. We worked closely with Abia Web3 Network to make this happen. The weather was terrible, it rained heavily for most of the day, but the people who showed up were exactly the right ones.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d7c54b8c707cd3eb1a11ae9f8bc94dba8e0b49e0.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/d7c54b8c707cd3eb1a11ae9f8bc94dba8e0b49e0\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124116_791\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d7c54b8c707cd3eb1a11ae9f8bc94dba8e0b49e0_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124116_791\" data-base62-sha1=\"uMNmfTwbwxjGF8lS4A4CaFI7JhC\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d7c54b8c707cd3eb1a11ae9f8bc94dba8e0b49e0_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d7c54b8c707cd3eb1a11ae9f8bc94dba8e0b49e0_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d7c54b8c707cd3eb1a11ae9f8bc94dba8e0b49e0.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"759086\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124116_791\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 108 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26370-setting-the-foundation-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26370-setting-the-foundation-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSetting the Foundation\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI kicked things off by breaking down what CKB actually is and why anyone should care. We didn’t just jump into code. We talked about why blockchain was created in the first place and how CKB stays true to those roots. We covered the Cell Model, explaining it like sealed envelopes, so even people without a blockchain background could understand. I also introduced RGB++ and Fiber Network and what they mean for payments and apps.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a9d7554eaa41e138aeac56000fdf24619864fe10.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/a9d7554eaa41e138aeac56000fdf24619864fe10\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124114_635\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a9d7554eaa41e138aeac56000fdf24619864fe10_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124114_635\" data-base62-sha1=\"oeu2AMvpirlqSBpvHhQBhppKrVm\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a9d7554eaa41e138aeac56000fdf24619864fe10_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a9d7554eaa41e138aeac56000fdf24619864fe10_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a9d7554eaa41e138aeac56000fdf24619864fe10.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"7A9C94\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124114_635\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 112 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26370-opportunities-for-developers-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26370-opportunities-for-developers-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOpportunities for Developers\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI also shared how developers can plug into this ecosystem. Through the CKBuilders program, there are hackathons, weekly tasks, and opportunities to get funded for building cool stuff. It is not locked behind closed doors. You do not need a degree or a corporate job. If you have the skills and you want to build, there is a way to get support.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c3bccb32de980e6b341b980188c259fa0cf08db6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/c3bccb32de980e6b341b980188c259fa0cf08db6\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124108_829\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c3bccb32de980e6b341b980188c259fa0cf08db6_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124108_829\" data-base62-sha1=\"rVzAUZksu5ztldstA5h8VKxRiPI\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c3bccb32de980e6b341b980188c259fa0cf08db6_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c3bccb32de980e6b341b980188c259fa0cf08db6_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c3bccb32de980e6b341b980188c259fa0cf08db6.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"66504C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124108_829\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 78.1 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26370-builder-spotlights-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26370-builder-spotlights-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eBuilder Spotlights\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe heart of the meetup was the builder presentations. Several local contributors took the stage to share their work and experiences.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRIVET\u003c/strong\u003e presented by myself \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jedi_dtechmaker\"\u003e@Jedi_dtechmaker\u003c/a\u003e . RIVET is a tool I built to back up GitHub history onto CKB, IPFS, and Arweave. The problem is simple. Right now, your GitHub profile can be wiped out overnight. RIVET acts like an insurance policy, making sure your work and your reputation on chain can never be deleted.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5ea82d6bd08e3528d2b66dcc49be5c68f783e8b7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/5ea82d6bd08e3528d2b66dcc49be5c68f783e8b7\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124435_676\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5ea82d6bd08e3528d2b66dcc49be5c68f783e8b7_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124435_676\" data-base62-sha1=\"dvncrtA2qyWPxUhpW3UgFqnpxPN\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5ea82d6bd08e3528d2b66dcc49be5c68f783e8b7_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5ea82d6bd08e3528d2b66dcc49be5c68f783e8b7_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5ea82d6bd08e3528d2b66dcc49be5c68f783e8b7.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"8CA6A1\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124435_676\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 116 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCKB IDL\u003c/strong\u003e presented by \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/owk50ga\"\u003e@OWK50GA\u003c/a\u003e  He explained that building transactions on CKB can sometimes be a headache because there is no clear manual for what a script expects. CKB IDL solves this by creating a standard way to describe and validate data before it hits the chain.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f865c9d9fc89569ed2bc4567c738819f34f22d54.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/f865c9d9fc89569ed2bc4567c738819f34f22d54\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124106_119\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f865c9d9fc89569ed2bc4567c738819f34f22d54_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124106_119\" data-base62-sha1=\"zrquAYj4oPRwLdHWscrAryDzeSM\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f865c9d9fc89569ed2bc4567c738819f34f22d54_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f865c9d9fc89569ed2bc4567c738819f34f22d54_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f865c9d9fc89569ed2bc4567c738819f34f22d54.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"849E90\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124106_119\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 115 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFreightOnNervos (FON)\u003c/strong\u003e presented by \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/birdmannn\"\u003e@Birdmannn\u003c/a\u003e . He introduced a system where every transaction is treated as a deliverable. Individual transactions are called “goods” or “services”, and they usually involve payments like tipping, raffles, or proposals. The overarching system that delivers these goods is called a “freight”. The main innovation is that FON lets you set social criteria and constraints that govern how these payments are executed. You can even use one freight as a condition for another. Beyond his presentation, he also took the time to explain the Nervos Network to newcomers and onboarded several developers right there at the event.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5aa37a726e47de563fb4ef329c0c4c4a65117461.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/5aa37a726e47de563fb4ef329c0c4c4a65117461\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124100_962\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5aa37a726e47de563fb4ef329c0c4c4a65117461_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124100_962\" data-base62-sha1=\"cVPdPdqDqWnIcLO9ugLXsNrab61\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5aa37a726e47de563fb4ef329c0c4c4a65117461_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5aa37a726e47de563fb4ef329c0c4c4a65117461_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5aa37a726e47de563fb4ef329c0c4c4a65117461.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"A8BAAC\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124100_962\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 115 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese sessions were not just about showing off work. They sparked conversations and gave attendees a chance to ask questions and engage directly with the builders in the room.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26370-connections-and-outcomes-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26370-connections-and-outcomes-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eConnections and Outcomes\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe best part of the day was the connections. People did not just sit and listen, they actually talked to each other and exchanged ideas. I met several developers who are ready to start building on CKB, which is what this was all about.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26370-aba-in-context-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26370-aba-in-context-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAba in Context\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAba is a city of makers. The people here know how to build things from the ground up and make them work. That is exactly why bringing CKB here makes sense. We have a growing community of developers who are ready to take on new challenges.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI wanted to show them that CKB is a tool they can use to create their own solutions. We do not have to wait for things to happen somewhere else. We can build them right here at home. This meetup was about planting that seed and showing local builders what is possible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26370-what-we-learned-and-what-comes-next-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26370-what-we-learned-and-what-comes-next-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhat We Learned and What Comes Next\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe rain definitely affected turnout, but we also learned we need to start marketing earlier next time. We will partner with more local groups in Aba and host hands on buildathons where developers can actually code together. This is not a one off. We are going to keep this momentum going.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d47b5cca8a4d9e300402db01f366c7aa26e5ef84.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/d47b5cca8a4d9e300402db01f366c7aa26e5ef84\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124051_667\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d47b5cca8a4d9e300402db01f366c7aa26e5ef84_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124051_667\" data-base62-sha1=\"ujHwEfcaEBEQ05IwqyoA4lrOhnK\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d47b5cca8a4d9e300402db01f366c7aa26e5ef84_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d47b5cca8a4d9e300402db01f366c7aa26e5ef84_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d47b5cca8a4d9e300402db01f366c7aa26e5ef84.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"645C57\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124051_667\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 141 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5c1684d895ba4139dd5f80e77c41f436122bca8b.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/5c1684d895ba4139dd5f80e77c41f436122bca8b\" title=\"IMG_20261005_124032_232\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c1684d895ba4139dd5f80e77c41f436122bca8b_2_690x459.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_20261005_124032_232\" data-base62-sha1=\"d8EaMl7EVdMUOgl5zjL9X98EgAP\" width=\"690\" height=\"459\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c1684d895ba4139dd5f80e77c41f436122bca8b_2_690x459.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5c1684d895ba4139dd5f80e77c41f436122bca8b_2_1035x688.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5c1684d895ba4139dd5f80e77c41f436122bca8b.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"A59C90\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eIMG_20261005_124032_232\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1280×853 174 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-26370-conclusion-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-26370-conclusion-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eConclusion\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u0